<title>USA: Willis Corroon completes W F Corroon sale.</title>
<headline>Willis Corroon completes W F Corroon sale.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Willis Corroon Group Plc said Monday it completed the previously announced sale of the U.S. and U.K. operations of WF Corroon, its employee benefit consulting and actuarial services unit.</p>
<p>On November 14, Willis said it executed an agreement to sell the operations to Buck Consultants Inc for a minimum cash consideration of $20.25 million, of which $10 million is payable on completion. The balance of the money would be paid over three years, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
